# Change workflow

When **making code changes** in this repo:

1. **Docs & skills** — update agent docs if behavior changed (full table in `AGENTS.md` → *Docs & skills when changing code*). Update corresponding `.claude/skills/` skill if workflow changed.
2. **Quality gate** — before finishing task (matches CI):

```bash
npm ci
npm run lint
npm run test
npm run build
```

Local extra: `npm run format` → `npm run verify`.

3. Fix lint/type/test/build errors until passing. Do not commit unless user requests it.

Details: `AGENTS.md`, skill `/verify`.
